 "rules": [
  "completion_* read 0 while the slot is empty (RTL REG_COMP_0..7 read completion_valid ? word : 0, axi_timed_command_scheduler.v:624-631); the model keeps its last completion after an ack",
  "a dropped completion's executed timestamp is 0 (RTL completion_words[4/5] <= 0 on every drop path); the model says None",
  "time advances event by event: the generator steps the model to every due queue timestamp, as the RTL dispatches on the cycle a command comes due",
  "every write is followed by a settle (model.advance_to(now)): the RTL's dispatch runs on the cycle after a push, ack or flush",
  "gpio_out is fake-only state (the driver exposes no GPIO attribute)"
 ],
